#===----------------------------------------------------------------------===#
# A barrier ends the stage at slot 10, and its threshold counts from the last ds_load before
# it. The refill goes no further than that load, so its wait gets weaker: 7 WMMAs, not 4. The
# load beside it lets a gap hold two loads.
