#===----------------------------------------------------------------------===#
# The window is empty, so the refill may only take a weaker wait. Tried after v[204:207], which
# rode on its wait, it makes that load wait too; the two then fit only at v[204:207] itself,
# which would move a load earlier, so they stay.
